msgid "Conclusion & Summary {#conclusion-summary}"
msgstr "Kesimpulan & Ringkasan {#conclusion-summary}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We have designed a series of code-focused exercises to illustrate the "
"DiVincenzo criteria using Qiskit. Through these hands-on examples, you "
"explored how a real quantum computing platform meets each requirement:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita telah merancang serangkaian latihan berbasis kode untuk "
"mengilustrasikan kriteria DiVincenzo menggunakan Qiskit. Melalui contoh-"
"contoh langsung ini, kamu mengeksplorasi bagaimana platform komputasi "
"kuantum nyata memenuhi setiap persyaratan:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Scalability**: building circuits on more qubits and understanding noise "
"scaling.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Skalabilitas**: membangun Circuit pada lebih banyak qubit dan memahami "
"penskalaan noise.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Initialization**: using resets and state prep to reliably start "
"computations in known states.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Inisialisasi**: menggunakan reset dan persiapan keadaan untuk memulai "
"komputasi secara andal dalam keadaan yang diketahui.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Universal Gates**: transpiling complex operations to a machine’s basis "
"gates, proving we can perform any computation.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Gate Universal**: mentranspile operasi kompleks ke gate basis mesin, "
"membuktikan kita bisa melakukan komputasi apa pun.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Measurement**: reading out qubits and dealing with realistic readout "
"errors.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pengukuran**: membaca qubit dan menangani readout error yang realistis.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Coherence**: seeing the effect of finite T₁, T₂ on algorithm fidelity and "
"the need for operations to be fast relative to decoherence.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Koherensi**: melihat efek T₁ dan T₂ yang terbatas pada fidelitas algoritma"
" dan kebutuhan operasi untuk cepat relatif terhadap dekoherensi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For completeness, we also touched on quantum communication aspects via the "
"Qiskit in Classrooms [Quantum "
"Teleportation](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning/en/modules/computer-"
"science/quantum-teleportation) module, linking the last two criteria (flying"
" qubits).\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk kelengkapan, kita juga menyinggung aspek komunikasi kuantum melalui "
"modul [Quantum "
"Teleportation](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning/en/modules/computer-"
"science/quantum-teleportation) Qiskit in Classrooms, menghubungkan dua "
"kriteria terakhir (flying qubit).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, it’s worth noting how these criteria come together in a real "
"quantum computer like IBM’s. A device like **ibmq_brisbane** has 127 "
"superconducting qubits (Criterion 1), each starting in |0〉 (Criterion 2), "
"with calibrated gate set and compilers for universality (Criterion 4), "
"microwave readout resonators for each qubit (Criterion 5), and coherence "
"times on the order of hundreds of microseconds vs nanosecond operations "
"(Criterion 3). For quantum networking experiments, IBM and others are "
"exploring microwave-to-optical transduction for flying qubits, and "
"entangling distant qubits (Criteria 6 & 7); those are active research "
"areas.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terakhir, perlu dicatat bagaimana kriteria-kriteria ini bersatu dalam "
"komputer kuantum nyata seperti milik IBM. Perangkat seperti "
"**ibmq_brisbane** memiliki 127 qubit superkonduktor (Kriteria 1), masing-"
"masing dimulai dalam |0〉 (Kriteria 2), dengan set gate yang terkalibrasi dan"
" kompiler untuk universalitas (Kriteria 4), resonator readout gelombang "
"mikro untuk setiap qubit (Kriteria 5), dan waktu koherensi pada orde ratusan"
" mikrodetik vs operasi nanodetik (Kriteria 3). Untuk eksperimen jaringan "
"kuantum, IBM dan lainnya sedang mengeksplorasi transduksi gelombang mikro-"
"ke-optik untuk flying qubit, dan menjalin entanglement qubit yang berjauhan "
"(Kriteria 6 & 7); itu adalah area penelitian aktif.\n"

